The bundled IP-to-country database is user-country.mmdb from
https://github.com/sapics/ip-location-db (sapics/ip-location-db).
Dataset license: Open Data Commons Public Domain Dedication and License 1.0.
The build downloads the official database and checksum release assets. It
verifies the database's SHA-256 digest against identical checksum snapshots
read before and after the download before bundling the database.
The database is used locally for display only; no IP address is sent to a
third-party geolocation service. Country is approximate and may be unknown.
